      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NAROBI NZ (6) resumes from a spell of five-and-a-half months after showing some very good form last campaign, closing it off with a win over 2230m at this track. Will have plenty of admirers. KITTYKAT CUTIE (4) saluted two starts ago at this track but didn't measure up at her latest appearance over 1800m at this track, beaten 20 metres into fifth after being handy in the run. Ideally placed and is sure to play a major role. IM ALL BUSINESS (7) was out of the money two runs ago then broke and finished sixth last start over 1800m at this track, coming home 8 metres from the winner. Tactics will be crucial from this wide draw. Finds a nice race and can make up for that last start mishap. SEASIDE LADY (1) cannot be ruled out after breaking her maiden status three days ago over 1790m at Mildura when sent out as the $2.30 favourite.",
